<item>
            <title>[LU-20301] ll_update_inode() creates a new lu_env on each call</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20301</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I was reading a debug log and saw that the &lt;tt&gt;ll_read_inode()&lt;/tt&gt; code path is allocating a new &lt;tt&gt;lu_env&lt;/tt&gt; for each new inode that is being created, with a slew of allocations:&lt;/p&gt;
